    "analysis": "Fleetbase is an open-source, modular logistics and supply chain operating system: a Laravel/PHP API plus an Ember-based console, with modules for dispatch and fleet ops, headless commerce, warehouse management, ledger/invoicing, customer portal, IAM and an AI assistant. It exposes a REST API, WebSockets and webhooks, supports extensions, and has open-source iOS/Android driver and storefront apps. Self-host with Docker via the flb CLI or use Fleetbase Cloud; aimed at trucking, courier, delivery and e-commerce operators and developers building logistics products.",
